OL,3,ASacha Baron Cohen to star in Quentin
OL,4,ATarantino's West End play
OL,5,
OL,6,FBorat actor Sacha Baron Cohen will star
OL,7,Fin a new play in London's West End from
OL,8,FHollywood director Quentin Tarantino.
OL,10,FThe Popinjay Cavalier, set in 1830s
OL,11,FEurope, was announced earlier this year
OL,12,Fand is the first play to be written for
OL,13,Fstage by the US filmmaker, who is also
OL,14,Fset to direct.
OL,16,FBaron Cohen said he was "beyond
OL,17,Fdelighted" to be working with
OL,18,FTarantino, saying: "When the best
OL,19,Fdirector in the world calls, you don't
OL,20,Fask questions."
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
